        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/extras/b464819fba624c8dcda0dd31a4ea12c0.avif?t=1753313479\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AQK&quot; is a job interview simulation game where you, a job seeker, face off against a series of eccentric interviewers in pursuit of that coveted job offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’ll face off against a cast of quirky interviewers who seem to have made it their mission to ask the most mind-bending questions possible..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay involves answering interview questions within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as time passes, your available response options may decrease—or even increase—depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the interviewers’ reactions may change based on your timing and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you answer—and when you answer—will be the key to landing the job.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/extras/b464819fba624c8dcda0dd31a4ea12c0.avif?t=1753313479\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;AQK&quot; is a job interview simulation game where you, a job seeker, face off against a series of eccentric interviewers in pursuit of that coveted job offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you’ll face off against a cast of quirky interviewers who seem to have made it their mission to ask the most mind-bending questions possible..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core gameplay involves answering interview questions within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as time passes, your available response options may decrease—or even increase—depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the interviewers’ reactions may change based on your timing and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you answer—and when you answer—will be the key to landing the job.</p>",
